      "text": "Cost management means monitoring, controlling, and planning AWS spending.\n\nIt is not just reducing cost, but:\n\ntracking usage\nunderstanding bills\ncontrolling budget",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Cost management means monitoring, controlling, and planning AWS spending.\n\nIt is not just reducing cost, but:\n\ntracking usage\nunderstanding bills\ncontrolling budget",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
